: "text", "content": ""}], "incorrect_feedback": [{"type": "text", "content": "Whoops! Something important is missing."}, {"type": "text", "content": "Maybe next time..."}]}}]}], "type": "scholar", "stimuli": [{"type": "welcome", "contents": [{}], "template_override": 1, "id": 0, "_data": []}, {"contents": [{"type": "slideshow", "value": {"coverimg": "engenn6le03ob08re2img09.jpg", "audiosrc": "engenn6le03ob08re2aud01", "images": [{"time": "0", "image": "engenn6le03ob08re2img09.jpg", "id": 0, "text": ""}, {"time": "100", "image": "engenn6le03ob08re2img09.jpg", "id": 1, "text": "<span class =\"strong\">Vanessa</span>: So are you looking forward to dinner tonight?<br />\n<span class =\"strong\">Sally</span>: Yes, I've never had to make a meal in a crockpot before. It smells amazing!<br />\n<span class =\"strong\">Vanessa</span>: That would be the rosemary and garlic. Can you pass me a few of those measuring cups?<br />\n<span class =\"strong\">Sally</span>: What? Are you making something else?"}, {"time": "15000", "image": "engenn6le03ob08re2img01.jpg", "id": 2, "text": "<span class =\"strong\">Vanessa</span>: I thought I'd surprise with some dessert. How does some sponge cake sound with cream and a punnet of strawberries on top? <br />\n<span class =\"strong\">Sally</span>: You're spoiling me.  We have to watch Boston Nights at nine. We can't forget!<br />\n<span class =\"strong\">Vanessa</span>: Absolutely! Can you come here for a minute? I need your help."}, {"time": "32200", "image": "engenn6le03ob08re2img02.jpg", "id": 3, "text": "<span class =\"strong\">Sally</span>: Sure.<br />\n<span class =\"strong\">Vanessa</span>: Pour two cups of sifted flour into the bowl with the eggs. from the cartoon and a cup of sugar.<br />\n<span class =\"strong\">Sally</span>: Ok ... what's next?<br />\n<span class =\"strong\">Vanessa</span>: You have to stir all  the ingredients.<br />\n<span class =\"strong\">Sally</span>: Hold on \u2026 Did you need this?"}, {"time": "48800", "image": "engenn6le03ob08re2img07.jpg", "id": 4, "text": "<span class =\"strong\">Vanessa</span>: Oh no, I forgot the vanilla essence. We've got to add a teaspoon of that as well.<br />\n<span class =\"strong\">Sally</span>: Sure \u2026 Oh No!<br />\n<span class =\"strong\">Vanessa</span>: Sally, maybe you should stay out of the kitchen that is after you help me clean up this mess!<br />\n<span class =\"strong\">Sally</span>: I'm sorry, Vanessa."}]}}], "template_override": 1, "title": "", "type": "audio", "id": 2, "_data": []}, {"contents": [{"type": "video", "value": {"images": [{"time": "0", "image": "", "id": 0, "text": ""}, {"time": "5000", "image": "", "id": 1, "text": "Quantifiers"}, {"time": "21000", "image": "", "id": 2, "text": "<span class=\"bullet\">Use quantifiers with countable and non-countable nouns.</span>"}, {"time": "42000", "image": "", "id": 3, "text": "<span class=\"bullet\">Use these quantifiers with countable nouns.</span>"}], "video_src": "engenn6le03ob08re3vid01"}}], "template_override": 1, "title": "", "type": "video", "id": 3, "_data": []}], "id": 0, "_data": [{"contents": [{"type": "has_nav", "content": true}, {"type": "has_exercise_controls", "content": true}], "type": "lab_options"}]}], "_data": [{"contents": [{"type": "lesson_name", "content": "Vanessa: Dinner for Four"}, {"type": "unit_name", "content": "Too Much to Eat"}, {"type": "position", "content": 8}, {"type": "origin", "content": "scholar > Looking to the Stars > Famous People"}, {"type": "lesson", "content": 3}, {"type": "level", "content": "B1.1"}], "type": "metadata"}, {"contents": [{"type": "test", "content": "false"}], "type": "achievment_test"}, {"contents": [{"type": "primary", "content": " Identify and describe personal and regional eating habits and cooking in  a range of communicative situations."}, {"type": "secondary_1", "content": " Understands important and some specific information and aspects of attitude and intention using a range of appropriate language, in written or spoken documents or presentations"}, {"type": "secondary_2", "content": " Understands important and some specific information and aspects of attitude and intention using a range of appropriate language, in written or spoken documents or presentations"}, {"type": "secondary_3", "content": " Writes short texts about presenting plans for a future activity at work using correct spelling, grammar, cohesion and coherence aspects appropriate to the communicative"}, {"type": "secondary_4", "content": " Writes short texts about presenting plans for a future activity at work using correct spelling, grammar, cohesion and coherence aspects appropriate to the communicative"}, {"type": "secondary_5", "content": " Understands important and some specific information and aspects of attitude and intention using a range of appropriate language, in written or spoken documents or presentations"}, {"type": "secondary_6", "content": " Understands important and some specific information and aspects of attitude and intention using a range of appropriate language, in written or spoken documents or presentations"}, {"type": "secondary_7", "content": " Understands important and some specific information and aspects of attitude and intention using a range of appropriate language, in written or spoken documents or presentations"}, {"type": "secondary_8", "content": " Understands important and some specific information and aspects of attitude and intention using a range of appropriate language, in written or spoken documents or presentations"}], "type": "objectives"}, {"type": "background_image", "content": "engenn6le03ob08re1img01.jpg"}, {"contents": [{"type": "heading", "content": "Writing a Recipe (Quantifiers)"}, {"type": "describer", "content": "To write a recipe you need to follow these steps:  <ul><li>First, write the list of ingredients.</li> <li>Second, include the amount of ingredients you need.</li> <li>Third, specify time of preparation.</li> <li>Fourth, add number of servings.</li> <li>Fifth, write the instructions to prepare your dish in steps and complete sentences.</li> <li>Sixth, add a last recommendation.</li></ul>"}, {"type": "example", "content": "<span class=\"strong\">Basic sponge cake</span><br>Preparation time: 45 minutes.<br> Servings: for 8 people<br>  Ingredients:<br> 8 ounces self-raising flour<br> 8 ounces butter 8 ounces caster sugar<br> 4 eggs<br> 1 teaspoon baking powder<br><br>  Preparation:<br> 1. Preheat the oven to 180 degrees.<br> 2. Measure all the ingredients into a large bowl.<br> 3. Mix all of the ingredients using an electric whisk.<br> 4. Pour the mixture into 2 non-stick 7 inch (18cm) tins.<br> 5. Place them in the oven till golden brown 15-25 minutes.<br> 6. Cool on a wire rack before serving."}], "type": "learning_points"}, {"contents": [{"type": "heading", "content": " Expressing What is Necessary"}, {"type": "describer", "content": "You can use the following to express what is necessary: <ul>  \t<li>You had better\u2026</li> \t<li>You have got to\u2026</li> \t<li>I'm going to have to\u2026 </li> \t<li>You need to...</li>  </ul>   \t\t\t"}, {"type": "example", "content": "<span class =\"strong\">Bob</span>: You've got to come to our downtown office!"}, {"type": "example", "content": "<span class =\"strong\">Waiter</span>: Sir, I'm going to have to ask you to turn your phone off."}], "type": "learning_points"}, {"contents": [{"type": "name", "content": "crockpot"}, {"type": "definition", "content": "a heated container to slow cook meals"}, {"type": "part_speech", "content": "(noun)"}, {"type": "example", "content": "Example: I've never had a meal made with a crockpot. "}, {"type": "audio", "content": "engenn6le03ob08aud01"}], "type": "target_word"}, {"contents": [{"type": "text", "content": " These are words you hear in the kitchen."}], "type": "target_word_describer"}, {"contents": [{"type": "name", "content": "rosemary"}, {"type": "definition", "content": "a green herb used in cooking"}, {"type": "part_speech", "content": "(noun)"}, {"type": "example", "content": "Example: I can smell the rosemary and garlic."}, {"type": "audio", "content": "engenn6le03ob08aud02"}], "type": "target_word"}, {"contents": [{"type": "name", "content": "sponge cake"}, {"type": "definition", "content": " a light cake made with flour and egg whites"}, {"type": "part_speech", "content": "(noun)"}, {"type": "example", "content": "Example:  How does sponge cake for dessert sound?"}, {"type": "audio", "content": "engenn6le03ob08aud03"}], "type": "target_word"}, {"contents": [{"type": "name", "content": "punnet"}, {"type": "definition", "content": "a small box to hold soft fruit"}, {"type": "part_speech", "content": "(noun)"}, {"type": "example", "content": "Example: Where is the punnet of strawberries?"}, {"type": "audio", "content": "engenn6le03ob08aud04"}], "type": "target_word"}, {"contents": [{"type": "name", "content": "sifted"}, {"type": "definition", "content": "put flour or sugar through a sifter or sieve to remove lumps or big particles"}, {"type": "part_speech", "content": "(adjective)"}, {"type": "example", "content": "Example: Add the sifted flour to the mixture."}, {"type": "audio", "content": "engenn6le03ob08aud05"}], "type": "target_word"}, {"contents": [{"type": "name", "content": "vanilla essence"}, {"type": "definition", "content": "a concentrated form of vanilla"}, {"type": "part_speech", "content": "(noun)"}, {"type": "example", "content": "Example: Don't forget the vanilla essence."}, {"type": "audio", "content": "engenn6le03ob08aud06"}], "type": "target_word"}, {"contents": [{"type": "name", "content": "teaspoon"}, {"type": "definition", "content": "a small measurement used in cooking and baking"}, {"type": "part_speech", "content": "(noun)"}, {"type": "example", "content": "Example: Please add teaspoon of salt to the batter."}, {"type": "audio", "content": "engenn6le03ob08aud07"}], "type": "target_word"}, {"type": "takeaway_extension", "contents": [{"type": "text", "content": "Go online and find a recipe you would like to try."}, {"type": "text", "content": "Write down the ingredients and instructions."}, {"type": "text", "content": "Explain the recipe to a partner aloud."}, {"type": "text", "content": "Try to make the recipe at home."}]}, {"type": "takeaway_assessment", "contents": [{"type": "text", "content": "I go online and find a recipe."}, {"type": "text", "content": "I write down the recipe."}, {"type": "text", "content": "I explain the recipe to a partner."}, {"type": "text", "content": "I make the recipe at home."}]}]}